   "text": "Toronto Metropolitan University International College - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nToronto Metropolitan University International College\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nToronto Metropolitan University International College is Canada’s leader in innovative, career-focused education. Located in the heart of Toronto, students gain real-world knowledge through co-operative education and internships and amplify their studies through zone learning and specialized minors. Toronto Metropolitan is one of the most applied-to universities in Ontario relative to available spaces and the University Business Incubator Index ranked Toronto Metropolitan#1 in Canada and #3 in the world among more than 400 incubators in over 70 countries. Toronto Metropolitan University International College provides pathway programs to enable international students to gain entry to the university.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:22\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 09:36\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nCanada\nYearly Fees\nMax: CA$29,877.00\nMin: CA$29,877.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n24%\n800 of 3,300 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1948\nCampus(es)\nToronto\nCountry\nCanada\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3rlSRWD8Qvo\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
